 "02 · Architecture": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span class=\"tdd-key__tag\">Key point</span><mark class=\"hl\">Components over inheritance.</mark> A creature is a light pawn plus small components (steering, vigilance, signals, debug). Brains set goals, components act, and <mark class=\"hl\">one brain per creature</mark>.": "abyss/tdd/",
