 "<b>Event Dispatchers</b> to communicate, <b>interfaces</b> when several components may react, direct calls when the target is unique.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>Read when deciding, announce changes:</b> values are read when a creature starts or makes a decision; changes are announced through Event Dispatchers.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>Data:</b> one Primary Data Asset per species, one Data Table row per research task, Toolkit variables for global tuning.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>Data Assets are read-only at runtime.</b> In play-in-editor they are shared with the editor, so writing to one from gameplay would change it for good. Only the Creature Tuner writes to them, on purpose.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>Defensive Blueprints:</b> every reference validated, a clear script error on critical failures, every Switch has a handled Default.": "abyss/tdd/",
