 "<b>One system, two scales.</b> The final Abyssal Presence is a scripted pass reusing the serpent’s segment chain at giant scale: <mark class=\"hl\">a 6 m serpent and a 150 m leviathan</mark>, one system.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "EQS tests, steering loop and the serpent’s Behavior Tree": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<b>EQS route, cheap tests first:</b> distance to the creature (a filter, kept as a ring), sphere trace from the creature (a filter), distance to the goal (score, closer is better), dot with the current velocity (score that rewards <b>continuity</b>, for smooth curves). The distance filter runs first, so fewer points need a trace.": "abyss/tdd/",
