 "05 · Observation system": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span class=\"tdd-key__tag\">Key point</span>When a creature starts a behaviour worth observing, it <mark class=\"hl\">adds it to a shared list</mark>, and removes it when it stops. While the player scans, the game <mark class=\"hl\">only checks that short list</mark> every 0.1 s, never every actor in the level.": "abyss/tdd/",
