 "<b>Forgiving by design.</b> Lose the target and you get a <mark class=\"hl\">0.5 s grace time</mark>, then progress <mark class=\"hl\">decays slowly</mark>: never an instant reset.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "06 · Player patience": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span class=\"tdd-key__tag\">Key point</span>Watching creatures can get slow, so pacing has <mark class=\"hl\">targets, checked in playtests</mark>. When a task stalls, the creatures <mark class=\"hl\">perform that behaviour more often</mark>.": "abyss/tdd/",
