 "07 · Creature Tuner": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span class=\"tdd-key__tag\">Key point</span>The Creature Tuner is an <mark class=\"hl\">Editor Utility Widget</mark>: a Designer picks a species, tunes it, spawns it and watches it react live, <mark class=\"hl\">without code</mark>. The editor and the play session are two worlds, so <mark class=\"hl\">a Data Asset is the bridge</mark>.": "abyss/tdd/",
 "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"node__icon\">⇄</span>Editor ↔ play session<span class=\"meta\">Editor Utility Widget</span>": "abyss/tdd/",
