 "<b>Debug tools:</b> on demand, each creature draws its perception cone (species values), vigilance bar and stage, trajectory, EQS waypoints, safety trace (green if free, red if hit), goal and active observables. The Gameplay Debugger covers Behavior Trees, perception and EQS; the Visual Logger replays a charge after the fact. Debug drawing is off in shipping builds.": "abyss/tdd/",
